json5_generator.py 与 in_generator.py 在写生成文件前会先读回旧内容做比对
（内容未变则不写，好让 ninja 跳过下游重建）。这个 open() 没有指定 encoding，
于是使用宿主 locale：中文 Windows 上是 GBK，而生成的源码是 UTF-8，读取即抛
UnicodeDecodeError，构建中断。

这个缺陷会潜伏很久才发作：首次生成时文件不存在，只写不读，不触发；只有当
生成器再次运行（改动任一 *.json5 输入，或上一次构建失败被 ninja 标脏重试）
且文件已存在时才会撞上。本次是被一次内存不足导致的重试翻出来的。

实测症状：
  make_computed_style_base.py -> json5_generator.py:316 _write_file_if_changed
  UnicodeDecodeError: 'gbk' codec can't decode byte 0x9d in position 118917

除显式 encoding 外，读取失败时按「内容有变」处理并重写，而不是让构建挂掉：
磁盘上可能残留任何历史编码写下的文件，而这次读取的唯一目的只是省一次写。
重写前 seek(0)，避免 truncate 后位置非零留下空洞。

同族问题此前已修过一次（patches-151 的 0001，中文 Windows 的 ACL 解码），
但那次只覆盖了 testing/scripts。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../renderer/build/scripts/in_generator.py     | 13 +++++++++++--
 .../renderer/build/scripts/json5_generator.py  | 18 ++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/in_generator.py b/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/in_generator.py
index b8155805ea..ff8d55b8db 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/in_generator.py
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/in_generator.py
@@ -57,9 +57,18 @@ class GenericWriter(object):
 
         # Only write the file if the contents have changed. This allows ninja to
         # skip rebuilding targets which depend on the output.
-        with open(path, "a+") as output_file:
+        # FingerBrowser: see the matching comment in json5_generator.py --
+        # without an explicit encoding this reads generated UTF-8 sources using
+        # the host locale (GBK on a Chinese Windows machine) and fails the build
+        # on the second run.
+        with open(path, "a+", encoding="utf-8") as output_file:
             output_file.seek(0)
-            if output_file.read() != contents:
+            try:
+                unchanged = output_file.read() == contents
+            except UnicodeDecodeError:
+                unchanged = False
+            if not unchanged:
+                output_file.seek(0)
                 output_file.truncate(0)
                 output_file.write(contents)
 
diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/json5_generator.py b/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/json5_generator.py
index fa11cd0941..dd15a5f64a 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/json5_generator.py
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/build/scripts/json5_generator.py
@@ -311,9 +311,23 @@ class Writer(object):
 
         # Only write the file if the contents have changed. This allows ninja to
         # skip rebuilding targets which depend on the output.
-        with open(path, "a+", newline='') as output_file:
+        # FingerBrowser: encoding must be explicit. Without it Python uses the
+        # locale encoding, which on a Chinese Windows host is GBK -- generated
+        # sources are UTF-8, so reading one back to compare raises
+        # UnicodeDecodeError and fails the build. This only surfaces on a
+        # re-run, since the first generation writes without reading, which is
+        # why it can lie dormant for weeks.
+        with open(path, "a+", encoding="utf-8", newline='') as output_file:
             output_file.seek(0)
-            if output_file.read() != contents:
+            try:
+                unchanged = output_file.read() == contents
+            except UnicodeDecodeError:
+                # A file left behind by a build under a different locale is not
+                # decodable here. Rewrite it rather than failing: the goal of
+                # the read is only to skip needless writes.
+                unchanged = False
+            if not unchanged:
+                output_file.seek(0)
                 output_file.truncate(0)
                 output_file.write(contents)
 
